Guild info as of March, 2006.


An echoing voice gives you the information you seek:
Name: The Conjurers
Command: conjurer
Creator: Quadra
Maximum level: 25


Description:
Conjurers are the masters of the protection. They have masteried the art of
creating magical protections and are often requested to party with the best
adventurers.


Joining requirements:
 Background must be magical (wrong or incomplete)
